<p style="text-align: center;">Catoctin View Lane. 10x8 oil on linen panel. 2014.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">This is a roadside scene just around the corner from our house, along the back road into our neighborhood. &nbsp;I pass it all the time and thought the look of the dark mass against the light mass would make an interesting sketch. I saved the thickest paint application for the foreground.</p>